Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,As a child, Hanuman flew toward the sun,\Nmistaking it for fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.32,0:00:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Indra struck him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.30,0:00:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The gods feared what he might become.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.74,0:00:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So they sealed his strength\Nbehind a curse of forgetting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.02,0:00:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Until someone reminded him\Nwho he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.72,0:00:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Your weakness may not be a flaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It may be protection—\Nwaiting for the hour you are ready.
